_:naa6bcbded161400d8b22cbd5025f016eb3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:template must be a string with well-formed brace delimiters:\n        every unescaped '{' must be closed by an unescaped '}' with no\n        unescaped braces in between, and every literal '{', '}', or '\\'\n        (both inside and outside reference expressions) must be\n        backslash-escaped.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractExpressionMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Expression Map must have one of rml:template, rml:constant, or\n    rml:reference, unless rml:termType is rml:BlankNode with no expression.\n    " .
_:n067d0a4438a4446388eb76137d5d1e2bb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^((?:(en-GB-oed|i-ami|i-bnn|i-default|i-enochian|i-hak|i-klingon|i-lux|i-mingo|i-navajo|i-pwn|i-tao|i-tay|i-tsu|sgn-BE-FR|sgn-BE-NL|sgn-CH-DE)|(art-lojban|cel-gaulish|no-bok|no-nyn|zh-guoyu|zh-hakka|zh-min|zh-min-nan|zh-xiang))|((?:([A-Za-z]{2,3}(-(?:[A-Za-z]{3}(-[A-Za-z]{3}){0,2}))?)|[A-Za-z]{4})(-(?:[A-Za-z]{4}))?(-(?:[A-Za-z]{2}|[0-9]{3}))?(-(?:[A-Za-z0-9]{5,8}|[0-9][A-Za-z0-9]{3}))*(-(?:[0-9A-WY-Za-wy-z](-[A-Za-z0-9]{2,8})+))*(-(?:x(-[A-Za-z0-9]{1,8})+))?)|(?:x(-[A-Za-z0-9]{1,8})+))$" .
_:n0829ecda89064db1909a7df75a46a556b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Exactly one rml:parameter or rml:parameterMap is required.\n        " .
