_:nd212b3dc69bc4a75a25e4353143fe3abb2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        The logical iterator (rml:iterator) defines the iteration loop used to \r\n        map the data of the input source. Depends on the reference formulation\r\n        if an iterator is necessary.  \r\n        " .
_:naa6bcbded161400d8b22cbd5025f016eb1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is\n            allowed.\n        " .
